{
 "title": "Vistaguard V1 house",
 "vo": {
  "lines": [
   {
    "id": "hook",
    "text": "If you just got quoted twenty thousand dollars or more for brand-new impact windows, you're paying two to three times more than you have to.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b1",
    "text": "Here in South Florida, most window companies don't source their own windows.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b2",
    "text": "They buy them from a manufacturer and add their own profit on top.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b3",
    "text": "Then they hire an outside crew to install them, and that crew charges its own price too.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b4",
    "text": "You end up paying extra twice.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b5",
    "text": "At VistaGuard, we source our impact windows straight from the manufacturer, and our own crew installs them.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b6",
    "text": "No broker in the middle, and no separate labor bill, because our installation is free.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b7",
    "text": "Same hurricane rating, two to three times less than what you were just quoted.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "b8",
    "text": "We've been installing windows in your neighborhood all across South Florida for over thirty years, we're licensed and insured, and every job carries a lifetime warranty on our products and materials.",
    "after": 0.05
   },
   {
    "id": "cta",
    "text": "Click Get Quote below to book your free in-home inspection and estimate.",
    "after": 0.05
   }
  ],
  "engine": "elevenlabs",
  "voice": "Michael (ElevenLabs v4, Kysvuk17R9MDAP9l089v)",
  "take": "FnmbdJJZ9U87Ave67wwm",
